@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Nanum Gothic
skinparam shadowing false
title 약 등록 검토, 정확 품목 저장과 지연 보완
actor User
boundary "PillIdentificationUI / ManualMedicationEntryUI" as Input
boundary "MedicationScheduleReviewUI" as Review
control "MedBuddyPrescriptionViewModel" as Results
boundary "CheckResultUI" as UI
control "MedBuddySavedMedicationViewModel" as Save
control "CheckCatalogMedicationDetail" as Catalog
boundary "Medication API" as API
control "CheckSavedMedication" as Persist
participant "EnrichmentDispatcher" as Enrich
participant "Local/cache/public detail sources" as Sources
database "Application DB" as DB

User -> Input: Select only desired pill candidates / validate manual entries
opt Pill candidates
Input -> User: Keep duplicates or merge matching schedules?
Input -> Review: Selected unsaved candidates and photos
User -> Review: Confirm dose, period, date, mode, slots and cycle
Review --> Input: Reviewed schedules (no save)
Input -> Input: Resolve duplicates using reviewed identities and schedules
end
Input -> Results: showMedicationRegistrationResults(source, items, save callback, photos)
alt Current idle flow accepts handoff
Results --> Input: true; own immutable review and temporary photos
Input -> UI: Close registration routes; reveal home-owned result
else Busy/disposed/stale flow
Results --> Input: false; keep input route
end
note over Results,UI: Pill/manual results do not request prescription-change radar.\nReview acceptance and candidate selection are not writes.
note over Input,Review: 같은 약 등록 화면의 "사진으로 복용 기록"은 등록이 아니라 복용 기록이다(PhotoDoseRecording.puml).

User -> UI: Save one / save all
loop Requested unfinished rows, sequentially for save all
UI -> Results: Request save; guard account and result operation
Results -> Save: Source-specific save(index, isCurrent)
opt Pill-photo registration
Save -> API: GET /catalog/{item_seq}; client timeout 5s
API -> Catalog: Exact local basic / approval lookup
Catalog -> DB: Read only; no autoflush, network or AI generation
Catalog --> Save: Same-ID detail or null/error
Save -> Save: Missing/failure/mismatch: retain selected candidate and reviewed schedule
end
Save -> API: POST /save after current-scope check
API -> Persist: saveMedicationDetail
Persist -> DB: Save/duplicate transaction
Persist --> API: Committed result
API -> Enrich: Queue best-effort enrichment target after commit
API --> Save: Saved / duplicate / failed
Save --> Results: Preserve completion before dependent refreshes
Results --> UI: Completed row locked; failed row retryable
end
Results -> Results: Refresh list, schedule, reminders in current scope
note right of Results: Refresh failure does not undo saved rows.\nNo atomic batch or durable registration-resume queue.\nTemporary photo cleanup waits for in-use saves.
opt Every row saved or duplicate
UI -> User: Centered completion dialog
User -> UI: Today schedule / pillbox / Home
UI -> UI: Close dialog, then navigate
end

group Independent best-effort detail work
Enrich -> DB: New session; check account, identity and regimen snapshot
Enrich -> Sources: Exact-ID local detail; only unique exact-ID cache/public match
Sources --> Enrich: Bounded readable source text / optional summary / failure
Enrich -> DB: Account lock; recheck identity, revision, unchanged blank fields
DB --> Enrich: Fill still-missing detail only, or skip changed/deleted/stopped target
end
note over Enrich,DB: Per-loop max 32 jobs, 2 concurrent; 40s lookup budget includes waiting.\nNot durable: overload, timeout or restart may leave fields missing.\nNever change dose/schedule or reverse the accepted save.
@enduml
